WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.682
Local smoothing for waves.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.479
Averaging a wave over time should recover smoothness.

3
00:00:05.479 --> 00:00:07.911
The best human result lost one twelfth.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.104
Split the wave into packets and bound how they crowd across scales.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.581
Claimed: any epsilon, in every dimension.

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.510
Lean checks it, in every dimension.
